		{
			title: "The Path of the Meal"
			x: -0.25d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "octagon"
			description: [
				"&2Ah, greetings again, Bandit! [Master Gardener Gray] here. I know in the whirlwind you've been in you may not remember us, but we helped guide you through growing and cooking your own sustenance in that strange dimension."
				""
				"&3Mmm yes, quite a strange place, yes. Oh, yes, I'm [Head Chef Charlie]. We see that you've found yourself in yet another strange place, though in... a much more precarious position."
				""
				"&4Very much so! [Barista Bae] here. You've not met me yet for sure."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Oh! [Barista Bae], didn't realize you'd be here. Where is [Food Critic Candy]?"
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Poor dear came down with food poisoning. Big chili cook off followed by judging an up and coming chef competition."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Oh no! Well, glad to have you on board at least!"
			]
			dependencies: ["1D0853ADC7295AEB"]
