			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "Mod : Cooking for Blockheads"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Ah, Cooking for Blockheads. Always a good staple for any size kitchen. "
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Betcha its why the FOPGame Server has copied it."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Quite true, quite true, yes. Well, doesn't look like they changed much, so it's quite simple to go over again."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3It's a simple start: Craft yourself a Cooking for Blockheads I book. This handy little thing will tell you what recipes you can make with the ingredients in your inventory."
			]
