		{
			title: "On the Farm"
			x: -9.25d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Farming for Blockheads"
			description: [
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Bandit, there's a lot to farming and gardening. What seeds you use, when you water it, how hot or cold it needs to be. But a lot of those don't matter in the FOPGame Server. "
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Getting seeds can be as simple as punching the nearest grass and hoping. Or, you can use this handy Market to buy more specific seeds you want."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4They seem kinda... pricey."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Unsurprising given the FOPGame Server runs the Market."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["4AFBF3206D6A0A5E"]
			id: "7D7C157DFC1B8A40"
