		}
		{
			title: "A Good Farm Kitchen"
			x: -8.0d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Farmer's Delight"
			description: [
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Ah, Bandit, have you gotten yourself a farm going yet? I highly suggest it, if nothing else the FOPGame Server has some decent options."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3They'd have to keep up with all the ingredients the worlds they digitize have."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Why would... oh! Maximize profits, right?"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Yes, though I wonder if they care about actual farming... But that's something to muse on later, Bandit. For now, how about you make yourself a Flint Knife?"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2You can use it to break tall grass, and you'll harvest some extra resources. The main one being: Straw. With this, you can make some Ropes to climb, as well as some nice decorative mats."
			]
