				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Bandit, you may be interested in this interesting little system that the FOPGame Server implemented."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh! What is that? It looks like Gray's farm journal."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Damned, figures they'd copy that product. Got the idea from those folks that like to post up pictures of their food. You use it to keep record of the foods you've eaten, so you can try more things out. What'd the bosses call it? "
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Ooo, so kind of like achievement hunting?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Kind of I guess. Though in the FOPGame Server, it ties to how many extra hitpoints you get. But you gotta try a LOT of foods..."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Meaning making a LOT of dishes and selling the remainders...sneaky."
