		{
			title: "A Garden Anywhere"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "Mod : Botany Pots and Botany Trees"
			description: [
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh Gray, question! Sometimes you talk about gardens, sometimes farms, also fields. What exactly do we use for growing?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Oh, not been down to the food and farm labs yet? Really should visit some time."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Ah yes. We have a mix of all of those. Some things only grow in very specific places, or temperatures, or times. Very strict requirements to grow makes some things difficult, you see."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Ooh I see."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3It looks like the FOPGame Server has their own... well, system for growing plants. Aside from classic farmland, that is."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Aye, Botany Pots. You can grow almost all crops and trees in em. Just Right Click the right soil and seed into it!"
			]
