		{
			title: "The Dream Sandwich"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "Mod : Culinary Construct"
			description: [
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Ah, looking over all the strange farming choices the FOP have made for their Game Server has built up an appetite."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oooh I could go for a sandwich or something right now."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Sandwich, eh? Well, we could always construct you one of our sandwich specials."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Tempting. Ya always have some pretty decent choices in the restaurant. "
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3We try. Unlike... well look here. Using this Culinary Station, you can turn ANYTHING into a sandwich or food bowl."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Anything?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Well, anything you can eat or drink. Just put (vanilla) Bread or a Bowl in the left, then fill the rest with food."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
