		{
			title: "Divine Food"
			x: 3.75d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "Mod : Sushi Go Crafting"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Ah, I see they FOPGame Server has it's own version of the TFB leaders' favorite products... or well one of them."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Sushi."
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Sushi."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Of course. Just a quick glance over, they've... pretty much copied it fairly accurately. Not even hiding it I guess. "
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Can't really copyright recipes and stuff. Thankfully, otherwise it would be a very cutthroat business then. Farming and cooking business that is."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Too true. Well, Bandit, if you want to get started on this journey, get yourself a \"Becoming an Itamae\" manual."
