		{
			title: "Who Needs a Table?"
			x: -5.5d
			y: 4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Seeing the recipe is quite nice, yes. But the Cooking for Blockheads cookbooks can do much more than that, with Cooking for Blockheads II."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh, a sequel?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3In a way, in a way. It's more of an upgraded version of the first book, Bandit. Instead of just showing you the recipes, you can craft most of them instead right inside the book!"
			]
