		{
			title: "A Simple Kitchen"
			x: -5.5d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3And from the humble but powerful cookbook, you can upgrade to a proper kitchen."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2And good, some proper storage for your ingredients. A pocket can only hold so much corn you know. Not a fridge in sight, though."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3That's a different lesson. First though, for the Cooking for Blockheads Kitchen to work, all the components need to be placed so that pieces touch each other. "
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3The Cooking Table is the heart of the kitchen. The Oven provides heat, the Sink provides water. And you can store many ingredients in the Counters."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh! Don't forget the nice looking kitchen floor!"
			]
