		{
			title: "More Tools"
			x: -4.25d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3There are many kitchen gadgets you can get, even in the FOPGame Server."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Though I have to say the Tool Rack is very much an essential thing. You can place your various cooking tools, like pots and pans and whatnot, on it, and they will be available for use in recipes."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3The Milk Jar is a special container for... yep, storing milk. Keeps it nice and fresh. Just place it on one of the Cooking for Blockhead kitchen counters, and Right Click buckets of milk onto it to fill it. Then recipes that need Milk will pull from the Milk Jar."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Ooo, a toaster. Right Click Bread onto it, then again to start it. When it's done, POP, Toast!"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Pretty much. Fairly unitasker in the FOPGame Server, though."
			]
			dependencies: ["7DDCC674E0378B37"]
			id: "7830589D5DF956C3"
			tasks: [
				{
