		{
			x: -5.5d
			y: 6.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Cabinets are all well and good for some ingredients. Canned and boxed food, shelf stable things, yes. Fresh foods? Small bottled spices? Not that great..."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Isn't it all digital though? With screens and things?"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Ah, it is, yes, but appearances are helpful. Especially as Bandit is stuck there for who knows how long, making things look nice and comfortable helps."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh! Good point. Storing spices and other small ingredients on a Spice Rack looks nice! Or a fruit basket on a counter. Seeing fresh fruit right there is lovely."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2And there's the Fridge, good. Keeps things cold, not that it's required for the FOPGame Server. But you can stack two Fridges on top of each other to make a normal sized one."
			]
			dependencies: ["7DDCC674E0378B37"]
			id: "40F916972FD5FF5F"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "152488E6A63FEB9F"
					type: "item"
					item: "cookingforblockheads:spice_rack"
				}
				{
					id: "36ABBB8FBA2B685E"
					type: "item"
					item: "cookingforblockheads:fruit_basket"
				}
				{
					id: "0FDE133B7D64FB61"
					type: "item"
					item: "cookingforblockheads:fridge"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "71D9DE7B1791838E"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Upgading Appliances"
			x: -4.25d
			y: 6.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Some of your Kitchen can be upgraded a few useful things. Like the Oven can be upgraded with a Heating Unit so that it can use FE Energy to cook food instead of Coal or Wood."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2That Ice Unit is quite useful in a Fridge. It provides Ice for your recipes and to help things keep cool."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh! That Preservation Chamber is super handy! It stops the last item in a spot from being used!"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Excellent if you are using a piping or similar system to keep your Kitchen stocked."
			]
			dependencies: ["40F916972FD5FF5F"]
			id: "709AFA8CEB8D239E"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "3450BDF76A06C890"
