		{
			title: "More Helpful Things"
			x: -8.0d
			y: 4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Always a few things around the farm that can help ya here and there. Like the Canvas Signs, look a bit neater than the basic wooden ones."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Ooo, Safety Nets, good for farms AND cafes! Gives a safe spot to land on when you jump off something high."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2What kind of farms have you been on?!"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Farms? What about cafes?!"
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh, just some interesting themed places. The Ferret Business has me traveling a lot to research up and coming trends."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Hmf, well, what doesn't change is needing good soil for farms. You can make some Organic Compost and then let it sit next to water to turn into some Rich Soil."
