		{
			title: "Rustic Kitchenware"
			x: -8.0d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Ah, nothing like a good rustic kitchen."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Agreed."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh, you don't put wood into this stove?"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Nope, it's all heated up and ready. Just pop a Cooking Pot on top, and toss the ingredients into that. "
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Don't forget a bowl or similar to serve in."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4What about a skillet? A fried egg sounds good right now."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Ah, the Skillet in the FOPGame Server is a bit... interesting. If you are standing next to a heat source, like a Campfire, the Stove, or similar, you can put something like an Onion or an Egg into your Off Hand, and then hold Right Click with the Skillet to cook it."
			]
			dependencies: ["5CA74EEBA6856C9B"]
