		{
			title: "Good For You And Pets!"
			x: -6.75d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Hey, Bandit. You probably already know, but a lot of the foods you can eat, aren't that great for the less sapient fuzzy friends."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh! Like cats and... onion? Or garlic? Or both? They shouldn't eat those, not good for them."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Yes, or like dogs and chocolate of course. But you can cook a few things in the FOPGame Server that are specifically good for tamed Wolves, like Dog Food."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3And Horse Feed for Horses. They not only feed and heal them, they also give them some nice buffs."
			]
			dependencies: ["025D4C8A072DA284"]
			id: "6ECBAE11912AD860"
			tasks: [
				{
