				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "A Good Feast"
			x: -8.0d
			y: 6.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Ah, having a good farm on hand makes for the best, freshest meals. "
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4And big feasts!"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Feasts? Ah yes! There are a few special food items in the FOPGame Server that are placed like Blocks, but then you pull pieces off of it."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Ah, the Feasts, yes. They are kind of like the Cake in game, except instead of eating a slice right away, you Right Click a Bowl onto the Feast block to pull a serving off. "
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Wow, four servings in each? That's a lot."
