		{
			title: "Helping the Animals"
			x: -9.25d
			y: 4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3That's a nice little box there."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Oh yes, I recognize that. It's a Chicken Nest, perfectly sized for those Chickens..."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Ducks."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3No, those are chickens."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4OH I had a texture pack installed. I forgot, sorry!"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Heh, early version of this game it was debated what they were. Chicken, duck, the Chicken Nest can automatically collect the Eggs they lay."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Now there's a good box I know about. The Feeding Trough. Feeds nearby animals with the food you put in... if they like it. All creatures can get kind of picky about their palette."
			]
			dependencies: ["7D7C157DFC1B8A40"]
			id: "6A831AD18B91FF5E"
			tasks: [
