		{
			title: "The Grind and Pour"
			x: -1.75d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh, make sure you have a good variety of cup sizes, Bandit! Never know when you want a good, small shot of espresso, or a big mug of something sweet. "
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Some coffees are best in certain sizes, and depending on the meal as well. A large cup of espresso might be a bit too much, even for a mustelid..."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Ah yes, please utilize the proper tools too, so that you aren't wasting precious beans!"
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4A good grinder is what he means. You waste less beans per cup of coffee, and get the best flavor that way!"
			]
			dependencies: ["437DC230732FC2D5"]
