		{
			title: "And a Good Snack"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3A good coffee break just isn't complete without a light, but filling snack."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Usually only got time to grab a muffin in the morning myself. Fill the thermos, grab a carby breakfast to go, get off to the gardens."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh! You might do better if you have a croissant, especially if you add in some roast chicken. More filling and very tasty!"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Hmmm, a good idea."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3A bagel is a bit more filling, especially if you find the croissant too light. If you want some sweetness how about....ham?"
			]
