		{
			title: "Really Hot Coffee"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Hey Charlie, what is THAT?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Well, I was looking into what else the FOPGame Server lets you do with coffee, and found some, well... interesting things."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2That looks a bit like a Magma Block. Is that what happens when you over roast their coffee?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Kind of? It's done on purpose it seems. Called a Magma Coffee Block. "
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4What do you do with THAT though?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3First thing I can find is as... road material? Apparently if you walk on it, you run faster. But it also burns you so..."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Not all that useful without strong boots..."
			]
			dependencies: ["437DC230732FC2D5"]
			id: "5DFCB0167F23F36D"
			tasks: [{
				id: "713866AFEF591893"
				type: "item"
				item: "ravencoffee:coffee_beans_roasted_magma_block"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "61E74C00B9FE4432"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Caffeinated Tools"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 6.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Ah here we go. Looks like those Magma Coffee Blocks can be used to make... Coffee Tools?"
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Wait, really? Are they any good?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Well, judging by the information, they seem to be somewhere between Iron and Diamond tools. They kind of remind me of Netherite tools."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Hah, made quite similarly it seems. Plates, ingots, then wrapping the base tool in the new material. "
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Well hey, if they are useful, always good to have multiple ways to use coffee! Wonder if you can nibble on the tool like chocolate covered espresso beans..."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2I'm not sure eating your tools is very good..."
			]
