				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Okay, so in the cafe, we have three 'normal' brews we do. From these we can make a lot of different blends and types!"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Much like a fairly basic but versatile soup base. A wide open palette with a lot of possibilities."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Oh an espresso is a good jump of energy... wait, that's a good question. Since its a game, does Raven Coffee give you more energy or anything?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Looking at the stats, looks like each brew gives various buffs."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Great! Oh, I guess they don't have any mixes using the espresso...but the Americano and Latte are very good starts for some really tasty drinks!"
