		{
			title: "Scheduled Harvest"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4So did the FOP copy a real product for the Botany Pots?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Surprisingly, no, they are taking advantage of the digital nature of the system."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2The FOP can innovate when they want to, its just easier to copy things. For Botany Pots, they 'magically' have all it plant needs to grow except the Soil."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3One thing they did copy is The Ferret Business' new automated hydroponics feature."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh, I remember that in the newsletter. The auto-harvesting thing, right?"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2That's the one. They call it a 'Hopper Botany Pot' however. It will automatically deposit fully grown material into an inventory under the Botany Pot."
			]
			dependencies: ["3D2D76F0362BB9F3"]
			id: "0C96DD8966CB02DC"
			tasks: [{
				id: "051364640F418624"
				type: "item"
				title: "Any basic Hopper Botany Pot"
				item: {
					id: "itemfilters:tag"
					Count: 1b
					tag: {
						value: "tfb2:basic_hopper_botany_pots"
					}
				}
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "02B9127C2F080BED"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Better Botany"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Mod : Botany Pots Tiers"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3I see they are toying with their digital systems again. They've released upgraded Botany Pots versions. Elite, Ultra, and... Creative?"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Oh? Interesting... looks like it not only makes things grow faster... but also output more product? That's not good."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Isn't it a digital system? How is that bad?"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2It's... tricky. While its a digital system, it's still actual materials. Which doesn't quite sound logical but... it's very tricky."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Think of it like uh... transporters from that space TV series. You get digitized, transfered over, then undigitized. You can't get copied 'normally', and errors in the system cause... heavy instability. This system might open up more opportunities for us..."
			]
			dependencies: ["0C96DD8966CB02DC"]
			id: "32B001B02AEEA4A6"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7D699DA4D88ADF6E"
				type: "item"
				title: "Any Elite Botany Pot"
				item: {
					id: "itemfilters:tag"
					Count: 1b
					tag: {
						value: "tfb2:elite_botany_pots"
					}
				}
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "5E39BEA3BD54F07B"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
