		{
			title: "Good Greens"
			x: 6.25d
			y: 4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Ah, some other vegetation you'll need, Bandit. The second most important ingredient : Seaweed, found in deeper waters."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3More specifically, Nori. You can grow more seaweed by planting it under deep water. You can then smelt it to get Dried Seaweed, then combine nine into a Dried Seaweed Block."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Ooo, do you slice that into sheets?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Nah, you press them by crushing the block between a Piston and an Iron Block."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh, neat!"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Also keep an eye out for Avocado trees, Bandit. They are used in multiple rolls. The trees are usually in Plains."
			]
