		{
			title: "The Most Important Ingredient"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2So the most important ingredient you'll need to find and grow, Bandit, is Rice. You'll find Rice Seeds scattered about if you break enough tall grass."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Good stuff, you'll use it in most sushi dishes."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2It grows differently than other crops. You plant it underwater, on Dirt. "
			]
