		{
			title: "A Good Catch"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Hm, I had a thought. Does the FOPGame Server have fish farms? Sustainable ponds that you can raise fish in?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Hm, I don't think so, but there's so much stuff with weird names I wouldn't be surprised..."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Oh, what fish DOES the game server have for Sushi? I always like yellow tail..."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Specifically for Sushi, there are Tuna and Shrimp swimming around. As in... not just randomly hooked with a fishing pole."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Though...why does the Itamae book mention bringing a saddle?"
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4What?"
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3What?"
			]
