		{
			title: "Chef's Equipment"
			x: 3.75d
			y: 4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Ooh, what's that thing there?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Oh, the Rice Cooker? It's for cooking up the rice for Sushi. Add Water, Rice grains, and something to burn like coal, and it'll cook up the Rice."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4No no, that barrel there I mean!"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Ah a Fermentation Barrel. A few of the Sushi ingredients takes a bit of fermenting. Specifically, Soy Sauce from Soybeans, and a certain type of Cheese from Milk."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Oh, Bandit, I noticed Sushi Go Crafting ingredients are... a bit different. They have their own volume, and you can't easily combine two 'stacks' together. The FOPGame Server added a Cooler Box that will automatically combine them."
			]
			dependencies: [
				"44B837D49943BAE8"
				"6C9CEB518367AC2C"
			]
