		}
		{
			title: "Chef's Tools"
			x: 3.75d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Okay Bandit, now that you got a good amount of ingredients grown and gathered, it's time to prep some of them. First you'll want a Cutting Board and a Cleaver Knife."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Ooh a cleaver? That's a pretty big knife."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Good size, nice weight, very sharp. To chop an ingredient, like say Cod into Imitation Crab, Right Click the ingredient onto the Cutting Board, then Right Click the Cleaver Knife onto the Cutting Board until its done. Then you can get your Roller."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Such a simple looking tool."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Yes, but its where the heart of putting together Sushi is done."
			]
			dependencies: [
				"6FDEC4AA02941656"
				"23B0EBA1252C959A"
			]
			id: "65F5B056E34DADE0"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "661752467DC81463"
					type: "item"
					item: "sushigocrafting:cutting_board"
				}
				{
					id: "7C6286DD7A83D4CF"
					type: "item"
					item: "sushigocrafting:cleaver_knife"
				}
				{
					id: "2C75E76258CE8C82"
					type: "item"
					item: "sushigocrafting:roller"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "6B91031586F6A8D0"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Classic and Simple"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Hm, the Roller works very differently than most things in the FOPGame Server that I remember."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Looks like they are matching it closer to real life for... some reason? It's a bit different, true. So, with the Roller, you can select the type of Sushi on the left, and it'll show you the different ingredients. Blank spots are either optional, or for fish or similar."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4What's that little slider next to each spot?"
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3That determines how 'much' of an ingredient you use. Each type of Sushi has a specific 'perfect' weight for each ingredient. If you find the perfect weight of an ingredient, the Roller will mark it for you."
			]
			dependencies: ["65F5B056E34DADE0"]
			id: "1B73FA3CD138D8ED"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "2918DB1A7487334E"
