			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Classic-ish and Fancy-ish"
			x: 6.25d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Wow there are a lot of styles  of Sushi."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Very much so, and each one can have lots of different ingredients. The FOPGame Server seems to have a lot of good ones too."
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2I see a problem though."
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4Wait, a problem?"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2Yep. It's missing the Owner's three favorite types."
				""
				"&3&l[Head Chef Charlie] : &r&3Of course, no surprise there. Subtle snub or just lack of care?"
				""
				"&4&l[Barista Bae] : &r&4No Inari? No Tamago Nigiri?"
				""
				"&2&l[Master Gardener Gray] : &r&2And no Spam Musubi. Yeesh."
			]
